# Tes fungsional Modul 9 (C.4). Jalankan BERURUTAN.
# Id kelas: IF101=1, IF102=2, IF303=5, IF310=12, IF399=13.
# Sebelum mulai: reset, lalu "go run ./tools/loadtest -mode crowd" sekali
# supaya IF399 berisi 5 peserta (untuk tes nomor 4 dan 6).

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 0a. Daftar akun mahasiswa uji (201; 409 bila sudah pernah dibuat — tidak apa-apa)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mhsuji", "email": "mhsuji@unair.ac.id", "password": "Rahasia123!" }

### 0b. Login mahasiswa uji
# @name loginMhs
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mhsuji", "password": "Rahasia123!" }

### 0c. Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Rahasia123!" }

### 1. Daftar kelas (200)
GET {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 2. Daftar ke kelas yang masih kosong — IF101 (201)
POST {{base}}/courses/1/enroll
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 3. Daftar ke kelas yang sama sekali lagi (409 ALREADY_ENROLLED)
POST {{base}}/courses/1/enroll
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 4. Mahasiswa ke-6 ke IF399 berkuota 5 (409 COURSE_FULL — bukan 500)
POST {{base}}/courses/13/enroll
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 5. Batalkan kelas yang tidak pernah diambil — IF303 (409 NOT_ENROLLED)
DELETE {{base}}/courses/5/enroll
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 6. Pindah ke kelas yang penuh — IF101 -> IF399 (409 COURSE_FULL)
POST {{base}}/enrollments/swap
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "from_course_id": 1, "to_course_id": 13 }

### 7. KRS setelahnya — harus TETAP berisi IF101 (200)
GET {{base}}/courses/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 8. Pindah ke kelas yang masih kosong — IF101 -> IF102 (200, jauh di bawah 1 detik)
POST {{base}}/enrollments/swap
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "from_course_id": 1, "to_course_id": 2 }

### 9. Pindah dengan from = to (422 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{base}}/enrollments/swap
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "from_course_id": 2, "to_course_id": 2 }

### 10. Lihat IF310 — catat "version"-nya (200)
# @name kelas310
GET {{base}}/courses/12
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 11. Admin ubah kuota dengan version terbaru (200, version naik 1)
PATCH {{base}}/courses/12
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "quota": 45, "version": {{kelas310.response.body.$.data.version}} }

### 12. Admin ubah kuota dengan version LAMA (409 VERSION_CONFLICT)
PATCH {{base}}/courses/12
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "quota": 50, "version": {{kelas310.response.body.$.data.version}} }

### 13. Lihat IF399 — catat "version"-nya
# @name kelas399
GET {{base}}/courses/13
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 14. Admin menurunkan kuota IF399 di bawah jumlah peserta (409 QUOTA_BELOW_ENROLLED)
PATCH {{base}}/courses/13
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "quota": 2, "version": {{kelas399.response.body.$.data.version}} }

### 15. Mahasiswa mencoba mengubah kuota (403)
PATCH {{base}}/courses/12
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMhs.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "quota": 99, "version": 1 }